   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "This: masculine, feminine, neuter",
     "texto": [
      "The demonstrative ends in the same way as the article: **dieser** (der) Mantel, **diese** (die) Jacke, **dieses** (das) Kleid, **diese** (plural) Schuhe.",
      "**Tragen** means «to wear» and changes its vowel: **ich trage, du trägst, er trägt**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
