    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The color in front of the noun",
     "texto": [
      "When the adjective goes **in front of** the noun, it takes an ending that depends on the gender. For now, learn them with what you wear (accusative): **eine rote Jacke** (feminine, «-e»), **einen schwarzen Mantel** (masculine, «-en»), **ein grünes T-Shirt** (neuter, «-es»), **blaue Jeans** (plural, «-e»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
